  "description": "*“In patients, out troublemakers.”*\n\nLee Si-jin, determined to save up a hundred million won and start a new life abroad, goes to an employment agency to apply for a hostess job in drag. But when he comes to his senses, he realizes he has signed a work contract for an oriental medicine clinic instead…?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3086001270), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/S2_1_punch), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230781), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61931593), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/love_hanbang), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056466), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H045005567), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10176914), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H045005567)",
